  "body": "Very often we need to find specific messages by date range, for example - in previous week. Seems at now there are no ability to find or filter messages by date and author in Matrix Server Side Search API: https://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/r0.2.0.html#id60\r\nAlso will be useful to filter messages by author.\r\n\r\nPlease add ability to filter search results by date range and author, and make `search_term` not mandatory field in search (for find all messages in date range).",
